  "ingredients": [
    "1 large head cauliflower, chopped",
    "1.5 cups shredded reduced-fat Cheddar cheese",
    "0.5 cup bacon bits (such as Hormel®)",
    "0.5 (8 ounce) package low-fat cream cheese",
    "0.5 cup low-fat sour cream",
    "0.25 cup minced green onions",
    "3 tablespoons butter",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FD-RjDMC31NC3sUHYETCv_tAb24=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/269422-low-carb-twice-baked-cauliflower-casserole-mfs-step-1-BP-2425-deb0f8ba998a4212bf220d6b4858baa3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269422/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large saucepan of water to a boil. Add cauliflower and cook until tender, but not overly soft, 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HOksBaJO0jirT2dT_9ARfcdy9NQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/269422-low-carb-twice-baked-cauliflower-casserole-mfs-step-2-BP-2432-b88e5ede1883434489387756203aee99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269422/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain well and transfer cauliflower to a large bowl. Use a potato masher to mash cauliflower, leaving some chunks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DWfQORqbfu5YXKiL-5LbTnhQVuM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/269422-low-carb-twice-baked-cauliflower-casserole-mfs-step-3-BP-2437-b486fd4c0f3f4b53842d5cf7e133dc11.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269422/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reserve 1/2 cup Cheddar cheese and 1 tablespoon bacon bits. Mix remaining 1 cup Cheddar cheese, remaining bacon bits, cream cheese, sour cream, green onions, butter, salt, and pepper into mashed cauliflower in the bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FwOPdBCoRQN7M9cq0QLu-VEri6k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/269422-low-carb-twice-baked-cauliflower-casserole-mfs-step-4-BP-2444-916c50fe825147868bc869b80b97037c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/269422/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mixture to an 8-inch square baking dish. Sprinkle reserved Cheddar cheese and bacon bits on top. Bake in the preheated oven until hot and bubbly, 30 to 35 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
